PITCH BUILD: ArtCraft branding
This build shows the ArtCraft wordmark and mark (assets/brand/) and the Craft apps' own app icons
(assets/apps/) because it is being presented to the ArtCraft Team. The ArtCraft marks are ArtCraft
Team trademarks under the terms in assets/brand/LICENSE-brand.txt, which do not cover this
project. Do not publish or distribute builds containing assets/brand/ unless the ArtCraft Team
has given written permission; to strip them, delete assets/brand/ usage in
crates/ui-egui/src/assets.rs and apps/creativecraft/src/main.rs.

App names in catalog/apps.toml (PhotoCraft, VectorCraft, Blender, Krita, …) are used only to
identify those apps so users can find, install and launch them. They remain the property of their
owners. Apart from the pitch-build branding above, CreativeCraft bundles none of those apps' code,
binaries, logos or artwork: Craft apps are
downloaded from their own GitHub releases at the user's request, and other apps are only detected
and linked to their official download pages.

